N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=common}}'''Lights''' is a {{C|Common|common}} knife that is obtainable by purchasing it from the Battle Pass during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
The knife is wrapped in a string of multicolored Christmas lights, with bulbs in red, yellow, blue, purple, and green. The wire wraps around both the blade and handle. The guard is gold.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Lights Gun (2025)|matching gun]] under the same name.